  "items": {
    "required": {
      "note": "Items from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tool_belt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tool belt</a> are not listed unless they do not work or are not automatically added.",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "req:9hyblh",
          "html": "3 different kinds of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">food</a>: 6 of 1 type and 7 of 2 others for a total of 20 pieces.",
          "text": "3 different kinds of food: 6 of 1 type and 7 of 2 others for a total of 20 pieces.",
          "alternatives": [
            "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Purple_sweets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Purple sweets</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Roast_potato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">roast potatoes</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mince_pie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mince pies</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Yule_log\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">yule logs</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mint_cake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mint cakes</a> cannot be used; stackable foods, such as <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Holy_biscuits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">holy biscuits</a>, will be counted as a single piece of food; cake can be used in all 3 pieces.",
            "An easy way to acquire the food items is to use the lodestone teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Port_Sarim\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Port Sarim</a>, which brings you right next to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wydin%27s_Food_Store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wydin&#39;s Food Store</a>, and then lodestone teleport right back to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lunar_Isle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lunar Isle</a>.",
            "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cabbage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cabbages</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Onion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">onions</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Raw_potato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">raw potatoes</a> can be found within <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rellekka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rellekka</a>. To use fewer backpack space, you can fill the vegetables into <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Empty_sack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">empty sacks</a>, or alternatively bring uncut <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pineapple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pineapples</a>."
          ]
        },
