        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "a-helping-hand:11ssi5k",
          "html": "Starting with one of your 7 item foods, feed him <b>4</b> food while cycling through your different foods.",
          "text": "Starting with one of your 7 item foods, feed him 4 food while cycling through your different foods.",
