          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/%27Bird%27s-Eye%27_Jack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&#39;Bird&#39;s-Eye&#39; Jack</a> in the bank. You will need 1 free inventory space for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cyrisus%27s_chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cyrisus&#39;s chest</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to 'Bird's-Eye' Jack in the bank. You will need 1 free inventory space for Cyrisus's chest.",
